heretic-mob-monster-release-master = The essence of { $servant }, your servant, fades from your mind.

heretic-mob-monster-release-named = Your mind begins to fill with haze - your master is no longer { $master }, you are free!

heretic-mob-monster-release = Your mind begins to fill with haze - your master is no longer, you are free!

heretic-mob-monster-freed-others = { $user } looks like { $theyve } been freed from the chains of the Mansus!

heretic-mob-monster-gained-human = You are a shambling corpse returned to this plane through the Gates of the Mansus.

heretic-mob-monster-gained-other = You are a horrible creation brought to this plane through the Gates of the Mansus.

heretic-mob-monster-master = Your master is { $master }. Assist them to all ends.

heretic-mob-lunatic-obey = Ruin the lie, save the truth through obeying { $master } the ringleader!

heretic-mob-soultrapped-intro = You are the trapped soul of the Heretic you once were. You may attempt to convince your wielders to unbind you, granting you some degree of freedom, and them access to some of your powers. You were enslaved by the cult, but are not a member of it, and retain what remains of your free will. Besides this, there is little to be done but commentary. Try not to get trapped in a locker.
